<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>All the way my Savior leads me,</l><l>Cheers each winding path I tread,</l><l>Gives me grace for every trial,</l><l>Feeds me with the living bread.</l><l>Though my weary steps may falter,</l><l>And my soul athirst may be,</l><l>Gushing from the Rock before me,</l><l>Lo! a spring of joy I see,</l><l>Gushing from the Rock before me,</l><l>Lo! a spring of joy I see.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>All the way my Savior leads me;</l><l>Oh, the fullness of His grace!</l><l>Perfect rest to me is promised</l><l>In my Father’s blest embrace.</l><l>When my spirit, clothed immortal,</l><l>Wings its flight to realms of day,</l><l>This my song through endless ages:</l><l>Jesus led me all the way,</l><l>This my song through endless ages:</l><l>Jesus led me all the way.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
